    "instructions": "roomy finds what is safe to delete on this Mac and removes it with safety checks. Start with roomy_status or roomy_report (roomy_scan if the report is old), explain candidates to the user with their `why` and `notes`, call roomy_plan_clean, and call roomy_clean only after the user approves. Never delete files any other way. Candidates with safety \"review\" need the user's explicit approval and allow_review=true.",
